      {
        "name": "places/ChIJ5T-MKRIBBDQRLDTIY5VlZ40/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25SaU5YSm1RWEoyYmxkR2JUSjBXRTlYV0hkVWJHYxAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "3 個月前",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": {
          "text": "2026年7月19日\n\n生啤酒價格在80到100美元之間，味道相當不錯。有些是IPA，有些則比較清淡，苦味也不重。我點了一杯6%酒精度的Duck Walk IPA。店面不大，但不擁擠。啤酒上得很快。",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "July 19, 2026\nDraft beer was $80-100 and quite tasty. Some were IPA but some were easy and not too bitter to drink. I got the Duck Walk IPA 6%. Small store but not unbearably cramped. Beer came out fast.",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
        "authorAttribution": {
          "displayName": "An",
          "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101615205910094288655/reviews",
